CI/CD IMPLEMENTATION GUIDE
Jenkins + SonarQube + PostgreSQL + Docker + Tomcat
Professional implementation and validation guide for a small Java/Tomcat project

1. Executive Overview
This document describes a simple two-server CI/CD architecture for a Java WAR application. Jenkins performs source checkout, build and test, invokes SonarQube analysis, waits for the Quality Gate, and then builds and runs the application in Docker/Tomcat when validation succeeds.
