18. Final Architecture Summary
The project uses a simple two-server design. Jenkins is responsible for CI/CD orchestration and Docker/Tomcat execution. SonarQube is a separate application server used for code analysis and Quality Gate processing. PostgreSQL provides persistent storage for SonarQube and can run on the same SonarQube EC2 instance for this small project.
All major scripts are attached along with this document.
